{"3744640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "NightBreak", "steam_appid": 3744640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌙 NightBreak</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's the middle of the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up inside your prison cell. <br>Most of the prison is quiet… but guards are still on patrol and searchlights sweep the yard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This might be your only chance to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>NightBreak</strong>, you and your friends play as inmates trying to break out of a heavily guarded prison during the night. Move carefully through the corridors, avoid the lights, search for tools, unlock doors, and find a way out together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But one mistake can give away your position. <br>Step into the light… or make too much noise… and the guards will know where you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together, stay out of the light, stay quiet, and make it out before the prison wakes up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔑 Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤝 <strong>Co-op Prison Escape</strong> <br>Play with friends and coordinate your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔦 <strong>Avoid the Light</strong> <br>Searchlights and lit areas can reveal your position.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔊 <strong>Noise Matters</strong> <br>Run, drop objects, or slam doors too loudly and guards may investigate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏚 <strong>Explore the Prison</strong> <br>Cells, corridors, tunnels, and hidden areas full of useful items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔑 <strong>Find Tools &amp; Unlock Paths</strong> <br>Search the prison to find keys, tools, and ways to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😂 <strong>Chaos With Friends</strong> <br>Even the best escape plan can fall apart in seconds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👉 Join the Discord to share ideas, report bugs, or scream together: <br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Third-Party Credits:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Headlamp</i> by NameSsis, licensed under CC BY 4.0.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Icons made by Freepik from </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌙 NightBreak</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's the middle of the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up inside your prison cell. <br>Most of the prison is quiet… but guards are still on patrol and searchlights sweep the yard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This might be your only chance to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>NightBreak</strong>, you and your friends play as inmates trying to break out of a heavily guarded prison during the night. Move carefully through the corridors, avoid the lights, search for tools, unlock doors, and find a way out together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But one mistake can give away your position. <br>Step into the light… or make too much noise… and the guards will know where you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together, stay out of the light, stay quiet, and make it out before the prison wakes up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔑 Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤝 <strong>Co-op Prison Escape</strong> <br>Play with friends and coordinate your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔦 <strong>Avoid the Light</strong> <br>Searchlights and lit areas can reveal your position.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔊 <strong>Noise Matters</strong> <br>Run, drop objects, or slam doors too loudly and guards may investigate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏚 <strong>Explore the Prison</strong> <br>Cells, corridors, tunnels, and hidden areas full of useful items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔑 <strong>Find Tools &amp; Unlock Paths</strong> <br>Search the prison to find keys, tools, and ways to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😂 <strong>Chaos With Friends</strong> <br>Even the best escape plan can fall apart in seconds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👉 Join the Discord to share ideas, report bugs, or scream together: <br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Third-Party Credits:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Headlamp</i> by NameSsis, licensed under CC BY 4.0.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Icons made by Freepik from </p></li></ul>", "short_description": "NightBreak is a co-op prison escape game set at night. Start in your cell and try to escape the prison with your friends. Explore, find tools, unlock doors, avoid guards and lights, and stay quiet — too much noise or one wrong step can give away your position.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744640/d7e1988312a2c3425102c165a623e151c3f0e6aa/header.jpg?t=1773847137", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744640/ad46efb72ef11e6b94b8f780dee4ba97d2b82d29/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773847137", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744640/ad46efb72ef11e6b94b8f780dee4ba97d2b82d29/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773847137", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 6gb GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10000 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>